===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{senseid|en|Q492}}{{lb|en|uncountable}} The [[ability]] of the [[brain]] to [[record]] [[information]] or [[impression]]s with the [[facility]] of [[recalling]] them later, usually [[at will]].
#: {{syn|en|recall#Noun|retention}}
#: {{ux|en|'''Memory''' is a facility common to all animals.}}
