# A record of a thing or an event stored and available for later use by an organism.
#: {{syn|en|recall|recollection}}
#: {{ux|en|I have no '''memory''' of that event.}}
#: {{ux|en|My wedding is one of my happiest '''memories'''.}}
#: {{ux|en|Sam and his friends will never forget the happy '''memories''' of the field trip to France.}}
